  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Skeletal hands burst from the ground in an area within range made of up to four 10-foot squares, which you arrange as you like, each touching at least one other. The area is &amp;Reference[difficultterrain apply=false]{Difficult Terrain} for your enemies.</p><p>Each enemy in the area when the hands appear makes a Strength saving throw. On a failure, it takes 6d6 Necrotic damage and subtracts 1d6 from all its damage rolls until the end of its next turn. An enemy also makes this save when it enters the area or ends its turn there, no more than once per turn.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 5.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-2ZbPYXTb7OXXfthH\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Place four 10-foot squares by hand; the effect subtracts the 1d6 from the damage rolls of attacks.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
